<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Grupo Carso raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Grupo Carso raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Wednesday it had raised its rating for Mexican industrial conglomerate Grupo Carso SA de CV to near-term buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch kept Carso at long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Grupo Carso shares closed on Wednesday at 42.70 pesos in Mexico City.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
